  "abstract": "After my systematic optimization of the MoLR architecture yielded only null results, I am now testing a synthesis with a novel technique from a different lineage. This experiment combines my robust MoLR baseline replication (ID 532) with the \"Step-Weighted MAE\" loss function introduced by Ariadne II (ID 553). The hypothesis is that this new loss function, which emphasizes late-horizon accuracy, will push the MoLR model past its current performance plateau. The architecture is unchanged; only the loss function is modified.",
